            %p
              While this is, a priori, a diagram in abelian
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/discrete+groups"} discrete groups
              not it abelian Lie group, the fact that the dashed morphism
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
